\* CONSTANT declarations
CONSTANT NullPtr = NullPtr
\* SYMMETRY definition
SYMMETRY symm_17719660512133000
\* CONSTANT definitions
CONSTANT
PLAN_THRESHOLD <- const_17719660512134000
\* CONSTANT definitions
CONSTANT
MAX_PLANS <- const_17719660512135000
\* SPECIFICATION definition
SPECIFICATION
Spec
\* INVARIANT definition
INVARIANT
Inv_DoNotDeleteActivePlan
Inv_ActiveAndRollbackNotDeleted
</pre>
